This archive includes original Bolt kernels from rui-ren/nemotron_ops,
distributed under the repository's MIT license, and IQ2 codebook tables
with their retained ggml attribution.

The embedded Mamba kernel images are generated derivatives of
state-spaces/mamba's Triton kernels, licensed under Apache-2.0.
The historical implementation adds CUDA launch wrappers, explicit rounding
boundaries, source-profile selection and a coalesced cached-state path.
The original license is reproduced in licenses/mamba-LICENSE.

The archived sources are preserved byte-for-byte. The rebuild wrapper
relocates local include paths only in generated build-stage copies.
